"Then my first Monday came," I continued my story.
I got ready in the morning and I caught the bus.
I went to my office for the first time.
Amit asked, "Did you feel scared that day?"
I answered, "Yes, I was a little nervous."
I went inside the building.
I found my desk and I sat on the chair.
I turned on my computer.
I logged into the system.
Then I met Rohan.
He is a colleague at my company.
He helped me a lot on the first day.
He showed me the whole office.
We ate food together in the cafeteria.
Neha smiled and said, "That was a very good start."
Sanjay said, "And now you have all of us in Mumbai."
I laughed and said, "Yes, you all are my good friends."
I finished my cutting chai.
I felt very good sharing these memories.
